<?page title="Responsive Grid Utilities" contentType="text/html;charset=UTF-8"?>
<zk xmlns:h="native">
<div sclass="z-p-8">
    <div sclass="z-border-bottom z-text-xl z-fw-medium z-text-on-surface z-mb-3 z-pb-3">Responsive Grid Utilities</div>
    <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-8">
        Marble 提供三個版面工具，全部用原生 CSS Grid、對齊 MD3/MUI，且大多 <h:b>不需要 breakpoint</h:b>。
        本頁由淺入深：先看基本用法，再對應到實際企業應用情境（不限本專案）。把瀏覽器拉寬縮窄，觀察各區塊的響應行為。
    </div>

    <!-- ============================================================= -->
    <!-- PART 1 — 基礎 -->
    <!-- ============================================================= -->
    <div sclass="z-text-lg z-fw-semibold z-text-primary z-mt-4 z-mb-4">第 1 部分 · 基礎用法</div>

    <!-- 1.1 z-grid-fill   -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-3">1.1 · z-grid-fill — 卡片自動填充換行</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-3">
            欄數<h:b>隨容器寬度自動增減</h:b>，每張卡片至少 <h:code>--zk-grid-min</h:code>（預設 180px）寬，塞不下就換行。
            適合<h:b>彼此獨立</h:b>的卡片牆、儀表板磚、產品列表。<h:b>零 breakpoint</h:b>。
        </div>
        <div sclass="z-d-grid z-grid-fill z-gap-4 z-mb-3">
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center">卡片 1</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center">卡片 2</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center">卡片 3</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center">卡片 4</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center">卡片 5</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center">卡片 6</div>
        </div>
        <h:pre class="z-bg-surface-variant z-rounded z-p-3 z-text-sm z-overflow-x-auto"><![CDATA[<div class="z-d-grid z-grid-fill z-gap-4">
    <div class="z-card">卡片 1</div>
    <div class="z-card">卡片 2</div>
    ...
</div>
<!-- 想要更寬的卡片：style="--zk-grid-min: 240px" -->]]></h:pre>
    </div>

    <!-- 1.2 z-grid-cols-auto   -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-3">1.2 · z-grid-cols-auto — 標籤欄 + N 個對齊欄</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-3">
            第一欄 <h:code>auto</h:code>（依內容自動撐，放標籤）＋ 後面 N 欄等寬<h:b>撐滿</h:b>，用 <h:code>--zk-cols</h:code> 控制欄數。
            重點是<h:b>跨列對齊</h:b>：每一列的同一欄都對齊。適合比較表、規格表、矩陣。
        </div>
        <div sclass="z-d-grid z-grid-cols-auto z-gap-3 z-mb-3" style="--zk-cols: 3">
            <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-secondary"/>
            <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-secondary">欄 A</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-secondary">欄 B</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-secondary">欄 C</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">第一列</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-py-2 z-text-center">A1</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-py-2 z-text-center">B1</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-py-2 z-text-center">C1</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">第二列</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-py-2 z-text-center">A2</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-py-2 z-text-center">B2</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-py-2 z-text-center">C2</div>
        </div>
        <h:pre class="z-bg-surface-variant z-rounded z-p-3 z-text-sm z-overflow-x-auto"><![CDATA[<div class="z-d-grid z-grid-cols-auto z-gap-3" style="--zk-cols: 3">
    <div></div>      <div>欄 A</div> <div>欄 B</div> <div>欄 C</div>  <!-- 表頭 -->
    <div>第一列</div> <div>A1</div>  <div>B1</div>  <div>C1</div>   <!-- 資料列 -->
    <div>第二列</div> <div>A2</div>  <div>B2</div>  <div>C2</div>
</div>
<!-- 所有 cell 是同一個 grid 的直接子元素，每 (1+N) 個自動換到下一列 -->]]></h:pre>
        <div sclass="z-bg-secondary-container z-rounded z-p-3 z-text-sm z-mt-3">
            <h:b>對齊重點</h:b>：上面所有 cell 都在<h:b>同一個 grid</h:b> 裡，所以 <h:code>auto</h:code> 標籤欄由全體最寬的標籤算一次、跨列對齊。
            如果你的每一列被包成<h:b>各自獨立的 wrapper</h:b>（例如資料列模板各包一個 div），各列就會各自算自己的 <h:code>auto</h:code> 欄寬而<h:b>失準</h:b>；
            這時把 wrapper 設成 <h:code>display: contents</h:code> 攤平回單一 grid（或用 <h:code>grid-template-columns: subgrid</h:code>）即可對齊。預覽頁的 State Matrix 就是用 <h:code>display: contents</h:code> 做到的。
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 1.3 z-grid-cols-N   -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-3">1.3 · z-grid-cols-N — 固定 N 等寬欄</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-3">
            最單純的<h:b>固定欄數</h:b>（1～6），每欄等寬撐滿、不換行。適合表單欄位對齊這種「就是要 N 欄」的版面。
        </div>
        <div sclass="z-d-grid z-grid-cols-3 z-gap-3 z-mb-3">
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center">1 / 3</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center">2 / 3</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center">3 / 3</div>
        </div>
        <h:pre class="z-bg-surface-variant z-rounded z-p-3 z-text-sm z-overflow-x-auto"><![CDATA[<div class="z-d-grid z-grid-cols-3 z-gap-3"> ... </div>]]></h:pre>
    </div>

    <!-- 1.4 怎麼選 (用 z-grid-cols-auto 本身排版 — dogfood)   -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-3">1.4 · 三者怎麼選？</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-3">（下面這張對照表本身就是用 <h:code>z-grid-cols-auto</h:code> + <h:code>--zk-cols: 2</h:code> 排出來的。）</div>
        <div sclass="z-d-grid z-grid-cols-auto z-gap-3" style="--zk-cols: 2">
            <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-secondary"/>
            <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-secondary">欄數行為</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-secondary">最適合</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-fw-medium z-text-on-surface">z-grid-fill</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">隨寬度自動增減、會換行</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">彼此獨立的卡片牆、儀表板磚</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-fw-medium z-text-on-surface">z-grid-cols-auto</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">固定 N 欄 + auto 標籤欄、跨列對齊</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">比較表、規格表、矩陣</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-fw-medium z-text-on-surface">z-grid-cols-N</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">固定 N 欄、無標籤欄</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">表單欄位對齊</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ============================================================= -->
    <!-- PART 2 — 企業應用 use cases -->
    <!-- ============================================================= -->
    <div sclass="z-text-lg z-fw-semibold z-text-primary z-mt-4 z-mb-4">第 2 部分 · 企業應用情境</div>

    <!-- 2.1 SaaS 定價方案比較   -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-1">2.1 · SaaS 定價方案比較</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-4">工具：<h:code>z-grid-cols-auto</h:code> + <h:code>--zk-cols: 3</h:code>。每個功能列的方案欄都對齊，最後一列放 CTA 按鈕。</div>
        <div sclass="z-d-grid z-grid-cols-auto z-gap-3 z-align-center" style="--zk-cols: 3">
            <div/>
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center"><div sclass="z-fw-semibold z-text-on-surface">Free</div><div sclass="z-text-2xl z-fw-bold z-text-primary">$0</div><div sclass="z-text-xs z-text-secondary">/ 月</div></div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center z-bg-primary-container"><div sclass="z-fw-semibold z-text-on-surface">Pro</div><div sclass="z-text-2xl z-fw-bold z-text-primary">$29</div><div sclass="z-text-xs z-text-secondary">/ 月</div></div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center"><div sclass="z-fw-semibold z-text-on-surface">Enterprise</div><div sclass="z-text-2xl z-fw-bold z-text-primary">洽詢</div><div sclass="z-text-xs z-text-secondary">客製</div></div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-pt-2">使用者數</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2">3</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2">25</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2">無上限</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-pt-2 z-border-top">儲存空間</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">5 GB</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">100 GB</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">1 TB</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-pt-2 z-border-top">SSO / SAML</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-disabled">—</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-success">✓</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-success">✓</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-pt-2 z-border-top">24/7 支援</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-disabled">—</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-disabled">—</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-success">✓</div>

            <div sclass="z-pt-3"/>
            <div sclass="z-pt-3 z-text-center"><button label="選擇" sclass="z-button-outlined"/></div>
            <div sclass="z-pt-3 z-text-center"><button label="開始試用"/></div>
            <div sclass="z-pt-3 z-text-center"><button label="聯絡業務" sclass="z-button-outlined"/></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2.2 雲端主機規格比較   -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-1">2.2 · 雲端主機規格比較</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-4">工具：<h:code>z-grid-cols-auto</h:code> + <h:code>--zk-cols: 4</h:code>。典型的「規格列 × 機型欄」二維對照。</div>
        <div sclass="z-d-grid z-grid-cols-auto z-gap-3" style="--zk-cols: 4">
            <div/>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-fw-semibold z-text-on-surface z-text-center">t3.small</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-fw-semibold z-text-on-surface z-text-center">m5.large</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-fw-semibold z-text-on-surface z-text-center">c5.xlarge</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-fw-semibold z-text-on-surface z-text-center">r5.2xlarge</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">vCPU</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center">2</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center">2</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center">4</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center">8</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-pt-2 z-border-top">記憶體</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">2 GB</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">8 GB</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">8 GB</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">64 GB</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-pt-2 z-border-top">網路</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">低</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">中</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">高</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">10 Gbps</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-pt-2 z-border-top">時價 / 小時</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">$0.02</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">$0.10</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">$0.17</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">$0.50</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2.3 營運 KPI 儀表板   -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-1">2.3 · 營運 KPI 儀表板</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-4">工具：<h:code>z-grid-fill</h:code>。磚塊彼此獨立、寬螢幕多欄、窄螢幕自動降欄，不需要任何 media query。</div>
        <div sclass="z-d-grid z-grid-fill z-gap-4" style="--zk-grid-min: 200px">
            <div sclass="z-card"><div sclass="z-text-xs z-text-secondary z-text-uppercase">本月營收</div><div sclass="z-text-3xl z-fw-bold z-text-on-surface">$1.28M</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-success">▲ 12.4%</div></div>
            <div sclass="z-card"><div sclass="z-text-xs z-text-secondary z-text-uppercase">訂單數</div><div sclass="z-text-3xl z-fw-bold z-text-on-surface">8,431</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-success">▲ 3.1%</div></div>
            <div sclass="z-card"><div sclass="z-text-xs z-text-secondary z-text-uppercase">新客戶</div><div sclass="z-text-3xl z-fw-bold z-text-on-surface">512</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-error">▼ 1.8%</div></div>
            <div sclass="z-card"><div sclass="z-text-xs z-text-secondary z-text-uppercase">轉換率</div><div sclass="z-text-3xl z-fw-bold z-text-on-surface">4.7%</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-success">▲ 0.5%</div></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2.4 產品目錄卡片牆   -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-1">2.4 · 產品目錄卡片牆</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-4">工具：<h:code>z-grid-fill</h:code> + 較大的 <h:code>--zk-grid-min: 240px</h:code>。電商列表、媒體庫、人員名片牆都是這個形狀。</div>
        <div sclass="z-d-grid z-grid-fill z-gap-4" style="--zk-grid-min: 240px">
            <div sclass="z-card"><div sclass="z-bg-surface-variant z-rounded z-mb-3" style="height:96px"/><div sclass="z-fw-medium z-text-on-surface">無線耳機</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">降噪 · 30hr</div><div sclass="z-text-lg z-fw-bold z-text-primary z-mt-2">$129</div></div>
            <div sclass="z-card"><div sclass="z-bg-surface-variant z-rounded z-mb-3" style="height:96px"/><div sclass="z-fw-medium z-text-on-surface">機械鍵盤</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">熱插拔 · RGB</div><div sclass="z-text-lg z-fw-bold z-text-primary z-mt-2">$89</div></div>
            <div sclass="z-card"><div sclass="z-bg-surface-variant z-rounded z-mb-3" style="height:96px"/><div sclass="z-fw-medium z-text-on-surface">4K 顯示器</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">27" · 144Hz</div><div sclass="z-text-lg z-fw-bold z-text-primary z-mt-2">$349</div></div>
            <div sclass="z-card"><div sclass="z-bg-surface-variant z-rounded z-mb-3" style="height:96px"/><div sclass="z-fw-medium z-text-on-surface">人體工學椅</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">網布 · 可調</div><div sclass="z-text-lg z-fw-bold z-text-primary z-mt-2">$420</div></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2.5 系統設定表單   -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-1">2.5 · 系統設定表單</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-4">工具：<h:code>z-grid-cols-auto-1fr</h:code>（= <h:code>z-grid-cols-auto</h:code> 的 N=1 特例）。標籤欄自動寬、欄位撐滿，標籤與輸入框整齊對齊。</div>
        <div sclass="z-d-grid z-grid-cols-auto-1fr z-gap-3 z-align-center" style="max-width:560px">
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">顯示名稱</div>
            <textbox value="Acme Corp" hflex="1"/>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">聯絡信箱</div>
            <textbox value="admin@acme.com" hflex="1"/>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">時區</div>
            <combobox value="UTC+08:00" hflex="1"/>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">通知</div>
            <checkbox label="接收每週摘要" checked="true"/>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2.6 角色 × 權限矩陣   -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-1">2.6 · 角色 × 權限矩陣</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-4">工具：<h:code>z-grid-cols-auto</h:code> + <h:code>--zk-cols: 4</h:code>。權限管理、功能授權、相容性對照都是這種勾選矩陣。</div>
        <div sclass="z-d-grid z-grid-cols-auto z-gap-3" style="--zk-cols: 4">
            <div/>
            <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-secondary z-text-center">Viewer</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-secondary z-text-center">Editor</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-secondary z-text-center">Manager</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-secondary z-text-center">Admin</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">檢視內容</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-center z-text-success">✓</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-text-success">✓</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-text-success">✓</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-text-success">✓</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-pt-2 z-border-top">編輯內容</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-disabled">—</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-success">✓</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-success">✓</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-success">✓</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-pt-2 z-border-top">管理成員</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-disabled">—</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-disabled">—</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-success">✓</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-success">✓</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-pt-2 z-border-top">帳務 / 設定</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-disabled">—</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-disabled">—</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-disabled">—</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-success">✓</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ============================================================= -->
    <div sclass="z-text-lg z-fw-semibold z-text-primary z-mt-4 z-mb-3">小結</div>
    <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-2">• <h:b>彼此獨立的卡片</h:b>（不需跨列對齊）→ <h:code>z-grid-fill</h:code>，用 <h:code>--zk-grid-min</h:code> 調卡片最小寬。</div>
    <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-2">• <h:b>標籤 + N 個對齊欄</h:b>（比較 / 規格 / 定價 / 矩陣）→ <h:code>z-grid-cols-auto</h:code>，用 <h:code>--zk-cols</h:code> 調欄數。</div>
    <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-2">• <h:b>就是固定 N 欄</h:b>（表單對齊）→ <h:code>z-grid-cols-N</h:code>。</div>
    <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-6">三者都基於原生 CSS Grid，<h:code>minmax(0, …)</h:code> 保證不橫向溢出 → 手機上不會冒出幻影捲軸。詳見 <h:code>doc/responsive-design.md</h:code>。</div>
</div>
</zk>
